<div id="menu"></div>

<main class="page">
    <h1>Table view</h1>
    <p class="lead">A UITableView with ContactTableViewCell registered for the "contact" reuse identifier. The cell's row html is its own <code>.xib</code>; the controller is data source and delegate.</p>

    <section class="demo">
        <h2>dataSource and delegate</h2>
        <p>Rows come from <code>tableViewNumberOfRowsInSection</code> and <code>tableViewCellForRowAtIndexPath</code>, which dequeues with <code>dequeueReusableCell({withIdentifier, for})</code>. Tapping a row calls <code>tableViewDidSelectRowAtIndexPath</code>; with <code>setEditing(true)</code> the delete button calls <code>tableViewCommitEditingStyleForRowAt</code>.</p>
        <div class="row">
            <button id="table-view-add" class="button">Add contact</button>
            <button id="table-view-clear" class="button button-secondary">Remove all</button>
            <span id="table-view-count" class="table-view-muted"></span>
        </div>
        <table id="table-view-contacts" class="contacts-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Contact</th>
                    <th>Role</th>
                    <th></th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody></tbody>
        </table>
        <p id="table-view-selected" class="output">Tap a row to select it.</p>
    </section>
</main>
